<title>AUSTRIA: Verbund 1996 EPS at 51 ATS vs 49 ATS.</title>
<headline>Verbund 1996 EPS at 51 ATS vs 49 ATS.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian national grid company Verbund's earnings per share rose to 51 schillings last year from 49 schillings in 1995, the Association of Austrian Analysts said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The company on Tuesday reported a 5.8 percent drop in 1996 net profit to 1.3 billion schillings, while pretax profit rose 7.9 percent to 1.524 billion schillings.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
